<title>GERMANY: SWIMMING-HAN XUE BREAKS WORLD RECORD FOR 50 BREASTSTROKE.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-HAN XUE BREAKS WORLD RECORD FOR 50 BREASTSTROKE.</headline>
<dateline>GELSENKIRCHEN, Germany 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Han Xue bettered her own world record for the short-course women's 50 metres breaststroke when she clocked 30.77 seconds at a World Cup meeting on Sunday.</p>
<p>Han set the previous best of 30.88 in Glasgow on January 29.</p>
